       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TH01HIST.
       AUTHOR.                 J.S. BUNGO.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS.
      *   THIS PROGRAM WILL RE-SEQUENCE THE PO FLAGS IN DPORECD.
      *   WITH THE H01 RELEASE, THE HISTORY DATABASE IS BEING
      *   MADE TO LOOK LIKE THE LIVE DATABASE (ADD FIELDS AND
      *   PUT FIELDS IN THE SAME SEQUENCE).  MOST FIELDS WILL
      *   BE RE-SEQUENCED IN THE DATABASE CL USING THE *MAP
      *   OPTION WHEN COPYING THE DATA BACK INTO THE CHANGED
      *   DATABASE.  HOWEVER SOME FIELDS, SUCH AS THE PO FLAGS
      *   NEED TO BE RE-SEQUENCED WITH IN A DATABASE FIELD.  THIS
      *   ALSO THE ACCOUNTING DATA IN DPOITEM NEEDS TO BE ADJUSTED.
      *   THE OLD HISTORY "SUB" WAS LENGTH OF THREE AND WILL NOW
      *   BE A LENGTH OF FOUR. SO, THE SUB-DETL AND ADDL-DATA WILL
      *   BE SHIFTED ONE BYTE TO THE RIGHT.  THIS PROGRAM
      *   WILL HANDLE THESE SITUATIONS AND SHOULD BE CALLED
      *   FROM THE CL THAT CREATES THE CHANGES IN THE HISTORY DATABASE.
      *
      *   DPORECD
      *       THE FIRST 2 FLAGS FROM THE OLD DATA SHOULD BE MOVED
      *       TO THE LAST 2 FLAGS OF THE NEW DATA IN THE 6 PO FLAGS.
      *       THE 3RD FLAG FROM THE OLD DATA (INVOICELESS INDICATOR)
      *       SHOULD BE MOVED TO IT'S OWN DATABASE FIELD AS DEFINED
      *       IN THE NEW RECORD LAYOUT.
      *
      *   DPOITEM
      *       SHIFT SUB-DETL AND ADDL-DATA IN THE ACCOUNTING DATA
      *       ON BYTE TO THE RIGHT.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       COPY SPECIALN OF COPYLIB.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DPORECD-ST
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLST0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT DPOITEM-ST
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLST0401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DPORECD-ST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-ST-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLST0301.
       FD  DPOITEM-ST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEM-ST-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLST0401.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  ACT-KEY             PIC 9(4)  VALUE 0.
       77  BASE                PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.

       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X   VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X   VALUE "0".

       01  OLD-ITMH-ACCTG-DATA.
           05  OLD-ITMH-SUB       PIC X(3).
           05  OLD-ITMH-SUB-DETL  PIC X(4).
           05  OLD-ITMH-ADDL-DATA PIC X(7).

       COPY DBSTAT             IN COPYLIB.

           COPY LANGSUB        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY VCOMLINK       IN COPYLIB.

           COPY TBLOWUP        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY DPORECDH       IN COPYLIB.

           COPY DPOITEMH       IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O            DPORECD-ST.
           OPEN I-O            DPOITEM-ST.

           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-ST.
           START DPORECD-ST KEY NOT < PORCVNO OF DPORECD-ST
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT
           END-START.
       READ-DPORECD.
           READ DPORECD-ST NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD-H
               AT END GO TO RESET-DPOITEM.

           IF POH-FLAG = SPACES
               GO TO READ-DPORECD.

      *------ MOVE FLAG 1 TO FLAG 5
           MOVE POH-TYPE TO POH-NON-RCV-INDIC.
           MOVE SPACES TO POH-TYPE.

      *------ MOVE FLAG 2 TO FLAG 6
           MOVE POH-BLANKET-INDIC TO POH-INTERNAL-ORD-INDIC.
           MOVE SPACES TO POH-BLANKET-INDIC.

      *------ MOVE FLAG 3 TO NEW DATABASE FIELD
           MOVE POH-ALT-REMIT-INDIC TO POH-INVOICELESS-INDIC.
           MOVE SPACES TO POH-ALT-REMIT-INDIC.

           REWRITE DPORECD-ST-REC FROM BUF-DPORECD-H
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.

           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE ERROR, DPORECD-ST" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               MOVE POH-RCV-NO TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

           GO TO READ-DPORECD.

       RESET-DPOITEM.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-ST.
           START DPOITEM-ST KEY NOT < PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-ST
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT
           END-START.
       READ-DPOITEM.
           READ DPOITEM-ST NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM-H
               AT END GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           MOVE ITMH-ACCTG-DATA TO OLD-ITMH-ACCTG-DATA.
           MOVE SPACES TO ITMH-ACCTG-DATA.
           MOVE OLD-ITMH-SUB TO ITMH-SUB.
           MOVE OLD-ITMH-SUB-DETL TO ITMH-SUB-DETL.
           MOVE OLD-ITMH-ADDL-DATA TO ITMH-ADDL-DATA.

           REWRITE DPOITEM-ST-REC FROM BUF-DPOITEM-H
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.

           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE ERROR, DPOITEM-ST" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               MOVE ITMH-PO-RCV-NO TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

           GO TO READ-DPOITEM.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               DPORECD-ST
                               DPOITEM-ST.
           GOBACK.

       999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TH01HIST" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
               VIEW-COMAREA COND-WORD BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
